ned representations, prediction readouts and registered training-loss mechanisms.\"], \"lineage\": \"parent_trial identifies a comparison and evidence lineage; it does not require code or architectural inheritance. inherited_components may be empty when the whole model is replaced.\", \"proposal_unit\": \"A coherent mechanism hypothesis can require several coordinated structural changes. Build that structure and plan component, replacement or factorial controls to identify where its value comes from.\", \"evidence\": \"Select by the equal-weight validation AUC mean across click, cart, favorite and purchase; report macro Logloss and every task change. Use that same rule for checkpoints, parents, topic gains, merge eligibility and final selection. Evaluate mechanism support, nearest-work differences and measured cost; compare closest architectural alternatives and the initial reference.\", \"fixed_contracts\": \"Available sample information, labels, data split, scoring, resource accounting and the frozen host training recipe remain shared. Internal architecture and readout design are candidate choices.\", \"reference_use\": \"UniRank comparison methods provide inspectable design references and nearest work. Agents choose and adapt mechanisms from local evidence.\"}, \"research_budget\": {\"seconds\": 43200, \"start_event\": \"new_campaign_started_with_verified_dataset\", \"start_unix\": 1794198624.5008233, \"deadline_unix\": 1794241824.5008233}, \"test_policy\": \"closed during research; any final suite must be frozen before held-out scoring\", \"source_sha256\": {\"baseline.py\": \"f4b473cbacf60d72cff90f3721ad754dd617ee6065fe3fca2fc9cd4be2b25c36\", \"train.py\": \"a313f015c9d03ae8244861bc36ff58517d8b630b968c397f404f627ea631522e\", \"visibility.py\": \"d1f641c62fa3c72e1eadc03aad6d999cc9af87fceb783775eb22d1405d9ac6b4\", \"data.py\": \"ef28cb65880b6931d3e567d2bfb4a67d7530c18067b68e47bf483b65b2560438\", \"selection.py\": \"aa519982aebe726806e1d11b68fca2574d33993778c33929