y change the proposed factorial or a frozen assessment suite: host must record omissions as unexecuted planned arms, retain all failure costs and restrict claims accordingly. '\n   'No automatic retry after unknown execution state. Stop on exhausted budget, user stop, information-boundary violation or no useful admissible complete experiment. A negative or unexecuted outcome is not scientific success.')\n }\n}\nvariants=[]\nfor name,file,role,desc in [\n ('rate_div_cov_exp','candidate.py','candidate','Directional candidate: diversity local-rate support, exposure covariance support.'),\n ('rate_exp_cov_div','control_reverse_support.py','control','Reverse mixed replacement: exposure local-rate support, diversity covariance support.'),\n ('tied_div','control_tied_diversity.py','control','Tied diversity endpoint; calibrates g2-r0016-diversity_joint.'),\n ('tied_exp','control_tied_exposure.py','control','Tied exposure endpoint; calibrates g2-r0016-exposure_joint and inclusive user-background lineage.')]:\n src=Path(file).read_text();tree=ast.parse(src)\n cfg=ast.literal_eval(next(n.value for n in tree.body if isinstance(n,ast.Assign) and any(isinstance(t,ast.Name) and t.id=='CONFIG' for t in n.targets)))\n sha=hashlib.sha256(src.encode()).hexdigest()\n variants.append({'name':name,'file':file,'role':role,'config':cfg,\n  'note':f'{desc} Standalone source SHA256 {sha}. Reproduce via frozen host runner: import this module and instantiate Model(feature_map, **CONFIG). No cross-file model dependency or host-training override. Expected32964809 total/31793216 embedding/1171593 dense parameters; unchanged module construction and RNG order. Host tensor/BF16/masking/backward, endpoint calibration and measured-cost checks remain pending. Preserve source/config/proposal/checkpoint hashes and complete validation/failure receipts. Existing g2-r0016-diversity_factorized remains mandatory incumbent and covariance-zero ablation; same-seed endpoint replays do not constitute independent repetitions.'})\nassessments=[]\nfor ident,refs,mechanism in [\n ('unirank-method-infnet',['unirank-code:INFNet','paper:infnet','unirank-benchmark-v2'],'task-mask sequence hubs and layer-wise aggregation/broadcast'),\n ('unirank-method-est',['unirank-code:EST','paper:est','unirank-benchmark-v2'],'sequence/nonsequence tokens and cross-attention with field-specific transformations')]:\n assessments.append({\n  'knowledge_id':ident,'decision':'considered',\n  'rationale':f'Retrieved card, resolved original-paper provenance, and read pinned benchmark forward and cached section2.3. Its {mechanism} is a relevant architectural neighbor. Original full-paper content is unavailable through the authorized cache; no external efficacy is imported. Review of latest_knowledge_usage: round16 declared both cards considered, executed diversity/exposure x joint/factorized replacements, and observed a crossover rather than a uniform diversity benefit. Declared consideration and source access are provenance, not proof of causal knowledge value. No new hub or interaction-stack component is adopted here.',\n  'transformed_mechanism':'No new component from this card is adopted. The changed mechanism is independent support assignment for the existing centered marginal product and covariance, prompted by local round16 receipts/source inspection.',\n  'variant_names':[],\n  'nearest_work_difference':'Preserve all current representation and interaction modules; replace only two reliability-selector assignments with a matched component-support factorial. No global novelty or original-method reproduction claim.',\n  'falsifier':'If mixed supports fail against tied controls and incumbent, the local added-utility hypothesis is unsupported; that outcome does not test or refute the full referenced architecture.'\n })\nproposal={'study':study,'parent_trial':c['incumbent'],'variants':variants,'knowledge_assessments':assessments}\nPath('proposal.json').write_text(json.dumps(proposal,indent=2,allow_nan=F